  "limitations": [
    "Official AI 3D clavicle detection and fully automatic feature remain missing. Requirement remains partial; no whole-feature acceptance or new adapter algorithm counts.",
    "Manual visible anatomy/category/ownership confirmation is mandatory. Existing explicit male/child labels conflict; no appearance-based demographic inference.",
    "Existing source contrast can reflect folds, tattoos, accessories, coloured light or errors. No physically separated illumination/anatomy or aesthetic quality claim. Flat/unsupported positive candidate refuses; partial admitted bands may remain unchanged.",
    "Only original/derived opaque SDR working-sRGB RGB; broader alpha/HDR paths remain unsupported, no silent clipping/flattening.",
    "Generic people-batch transfer validates real full render and target-owned coverage metadata but lacks dedicated per-target before/after image review. Generic derived preset installation stays guarded; explicit owner mapping remains separate.",
    "CPU/GPU boundary transport, source ROI memory admission and cancellation are source design only, not measured performance or 24MP support guarantees.",
    "All product imports, test execution, build/compiler/typecheck, model inference/download, numerical/photo/quality/export/project/history/performance acceptance UNRUN."
  ],
